Running evaluations
step 1:
uv run python -m spacy download en_core_web_sm
step 2:
uv run python -m pytest evals/test_full_eval.py
uv run python -m pytest evals/test_full_eval.py -m full_eval -s -v --tb=short

Flag	What it does
uv run python -m pytest	Runs pytest through Python (bypasses the Smart App Control block on pytest.exe)
evals/test_full_eval.py	Targets your specific test file
-m full_eval	Selects only tests marked with full_eval (your pytestmark)
-s	Shows print() and log_eval output live — critical for seeing progress
-v	Verbose test names
--tb=short	Shorter tracebacks on failure
